129
00:04:36,677 --> 00:04:38,499
Now, problem number two,

130
00:04:38,499 --> 00:04:40,625
and it is the camera itself.

131
00:04:40,974 --> 00:04:43,587
Problem number two is the backup camera.

132
00:04:43,767 --> 00:04:45,376
Since twenty eighteen,

133
00:04:45,376 --> 00:04:48,669
