148
00:05:22,247 --> 00:05:25,948
reverse, according to federal campaign data compiled

149
00:05:25,948 --> 00:05:27,015
by Lemberg Law.

150
00:05:27,195 --> 00:05:29,977
And Ford recalled sixty-five thousand,

151
00:05:29,977 --> 00:05:34,077
three hundred eighty-five twenty twenty-three and twenty

152
00:05:34,077 --> 00:05:37,371
twenty-four Super Duty trucks whose SYNC four

153
00:05:37,371 --> 00:05:39,567
software could show a delayed,

154
00:05:39,567 --> 00:05:41,836
