155
00:05:41,836 --> 00:05:44,692
according to Pickup Truck and SUV Talk.

156
00:05:45,041 --> 00:05:47,654
But Ford's camera story is the biggest.

157
00:05:47,834 --> 00:05:50,115
In October twenty twenty-five,

158
00:05:50,115 --> 00:05:53,081
Reuters reported a recall of nearly one

159
00:05:53,081 --> 00:05:56,352
point four five million older Ford vehicles

160
