163
00:06:05,278 --> 00:06:08,048
Ford knew of about twelve thousand,

164
00:06:08,048 --> 00:06:11,688
five hundred warranty claims and five crashes,

165
00:06:11,688 --> 00:06:13,033
with no injuries.

166
00:06:13,213 --> 00:06:15,596
And in November twenty twenty-four,

167
00:06:15,596 --> 00:06:17,775
Ford had agreed to a one hundred

168
