178
00:06:44,921 --> 00:06:47,100
If you own one of those F-150s

179
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:48,698
and your camera fails,

180
00:06:48,698 --> 00:06:50,659
you may not have to pay for

181
00:06:50,659 --> 00:06:50,877
