187
00:06:59,893 --> 00:07:01,644
and watch for a delay,

188
00:07:01,644 --> 00:07:02,838
a black screen,

189
00:07:02,838 --> 00:07:04,509
or a distorted image.

190
00:07:04,689 --> 00:07:05,897
Then run the VIN,

191
00:07:05,897 --> 00:07:08,598
because a camera recall may already be

192
00:07:08,598 --> 00:07:09,948
open on that truck.

193
00:07:10,128 --> 00:07:13,071
And remember that camera problems are often

194
00:07:13,071 --> 00:07:15,535
software, so a dealer update can fix

195
00:07:15,535 --> 00:07:16,630
